1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,815
Part twenty-one. SuryaSetu on your phone.

2
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:07,966
On a phone, SuryaSetu has its own layout.

3
00:00:07,966 --> 00:00:14,194
The Home screen shows your apps as tiles, and the bar at the bottom has Home,

4
00:00:14,194 --> 00:00:17,672
Dashboard, Search, Alerts and your account.

5
00:00:18,570 --> 00:00:21,464
Lists become cards that are easy to tap.

6
00:00:21,464 --> 00:00:24,575
Open a lead to call or WhatsApp in one tap.

7
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:30,632
Meeting a new customer?

8
00:00:30,632 --> 00:00:35,330
Add the lead right there: the form is one column with big fields,

9
00:00:35,330 --> 00:00:38,438
and Save stays at the bottom of the screen.

10
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:46,266
On site, Site photo opens the camera with the GPS place, ready to stamp your photo.

11
00:00:46,266 --> 00:00:52,116
Install SuryaSetu on your phone so it opens full screen, like any app.

12
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:56,593
That is the whole guide. Thank you for watching!

